      "content": "i know i should talk to my doc but they're super hard to reach and i've already got the valium here from a previous prescription. i just want to know if it's safe for a one-off night. like, if i just take a small dose like 2mg or 5mg of the valium with my usual seroquel, is that actually gonna cause breathing problems or is that just worst case scenario stuff? i'm just really tired of being awake.",
